      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. **Application and Other Acts Authorized.** The Commissioner of Environmental Protection is hereby authorized to act on behalf of the City in all matters related to funding by the State of hazardous waste site remediation projects known as Pelham Bay, Brookfield, Pennsylvania and Fountain Avenue Landfills, in Title 3 of Article 52 of the Environmental Conservation Law, including but not limited to making applications, executing the State Assistance Contract, and submitting project documentation.",
